190	MiniLM & --- & $+$0.208 & 0.011 & --- & --- \\
191	MiniLM & log freq & --- & --- & $+$0.133 & 0.107 \\
192	MiniLM & log freq $+$ degree & --- & --- & --- & 0.226 \\
193	\midrule
194	Qwen3 & --- & $+$0.184 & 0.025 & --- & --- \\
195	Qwen3 & degree centrality & --- & --- & $+$0.063 & 0.442 \\
196	Qwen3 & log freq $+$ degree & --- & --- & --- & 0.439 \\
